  "job_B3.3.17.2_20251003_114701": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00e6ringa Swylce w\u00e6s eft o\u00feer wundor \u00f0\u00e6m onlic. \u00de\u00e6t gelamp sume si\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r he sum deofolgild br\u00e6c & fylde, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r gebr\u00e6gd \u00feara h\u00e6\u00feenra manna Gelomlic \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feonne w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6r he \u00fea idlan gild br\u00e6c, & him \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0nan men wi\u00feerwearde w\u00e6ron, \u00fe\u00e6t To\u00fe\u00e6s mihtig he \u00feonne w\u00e6s \u00e6lce untrumnesse to h\u00e6lenne, & to\u00f0\u00e6s myccle gife he \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6t Gode Ge \u00fe\u00e6t oft gelamp, \u00feonne man hwylcne d\u00e6l his hr\u00e6gles to untruman men brohte, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00f0onne \u00feurh & \u00fe\u00e6s he w\u00e6s \u00f0onne ealles swi\u00feost to hergenne, \u00fe\u00e6t he n\u00e6fre n\u00e6nigum woruldricum men ne cininge Uere beatus uir in quo dolus; \u00f0is w\u00e6s so\u00f0lice eadig wer, ne w\u00e6s \u00e6fre facen ne inwid on his heortan, & efne heofonlice blisse & gefean mon mihte a on his mode & on his andwleotan ongytan. Ne gehyrde n\u00e6nig man on his mu\u00fee oht elles nefne Cristes lof & nytte spr\u00e6ce, ne on his heortan buton Swa eac \u00fees eadiga wer miccle \u00e6r beforan \u00feone d\u00e6g wiste his for\u00f0fore, & him Drihten \u00fe\u00e6t gecy\u00feed \u00d0a wiste he sumne hired on his bisceopscire, \u00fee \u00fea unge\u00few\u00e6re & ungesibbe him betweonum w\u00e6ron, \u00d0a he \u00fea h\u00e6fde \u00feone hired gesibbodne \u00fee he \u00fe\u00e6r to ferde, & \u00fe\u00e6r dagas wel manige w\u00e6s, \u00fea",
